          "heading": "Former Bulls colleague Chris Rossouw expects Jake White's Fiji to surprise people",
          "body": "Jake White's first test in charge is against Japan this Saturday, and former Bulls backline coach Chris Rossouw is already backing him. “I wouldn’t be surprised if they’re going to surprise people,” Rossouw said, adding that he was happy for White. Fiji, ranked 10th and having lost four of five Tests this year, then face France, Ireland and Italy in November."
