          "body": "Head of rugby Johann van Graan said Henry Arundell could be back in the mix this weekend, after the England hopeful missed the start of the season with a back issue. Will Muir and Tom de Glanville have resumed elements of training, but Bath say their availability will be assessed week by week and there is no concrete return date for the trio. One-cap England winger Muir has been out since shoulder surgery last season."
