          "kicker": "Champions Cup",
          "heading": "Robson calls Maxime Lucu's 803 kicking metres 'ridiculous' in 36-36 draw",
          "body": "Gloucester scrum-half Dan Robson, an England exile who spent a season with Pau in the Top 14, has called Bordeaux-Bègles' Maxime Lucu's 803 kicking metres 'ridiculous' after the Champions Cup game finished 36-36. Robson said the 'overriding feeling' in the Gloucester huddle was disappointment. Lucu played the night at fly-half, and Robson conceded Gloucester's kick decisions and discipline let Bordeaux into their 22 too often."
