          "heading": "Scotland women slump to eighth straight defeat in 56-12 Wallaroos rout",
          "body": "Scotland's women lost their eighth straight match on Saturday, beaten 56-12 by Australia in the WXV Global Series in Sydney. Under caretaker head coach Dave Butcher, the Scots led 5-0 early through Katie Buchanan, but the Wallaroos scored five tries before half-time and eight in all. Rachel Malcolm also scored for Scotland. Australia had also beaten Scotland 30-10 in Edinburgh last month."
