          "kicker": "Squad snub",
          "heading": "Macs Page omitted from Wales squad despite four tries this season",
          "body": "Scarlets centre Macs Page has been left out of Steve Tandy's 39-man squad for the Nations Championship, despite scoring four tries in four appearances this season. Scarlets director of rugby Nigel Davies said Page is \"probably the first name on the team sheet\", and the 21-year-old is qualified for Ireland and has been linked with a Munster offer. Tandy has instead picked Dragons wing Rio Dyer, leaving Page the likely next name in line if injuries strike."
